<title>USA: DSI Industries to book $632,710 gain.</title>
<headline>DSI Industries to book $632,710 gain.</headline>
<dateline>LUBBOCK, TEX. 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSI Industries Inc said it will book a gain of $632,710 from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>The company does not yet know to which quarter it will book the gain, said David Ridley, DSI's chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company is now in its first fiscal quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Ridley said the discontinued operations were both discontinued in 1995. One was a nursery segment in Florida and the other an MRI segment in New York, he said.</p>
</text>
